        <item>
            <title>1.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:14:24 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611201508</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Fixed: the Mac could crash on opening Getting Started or a long page, and use a full CPU core.</li>
  <li>Help › Enishi Help (⌘?) opens Getting Started.</li>
  <li>Settings on the Mac has a sidebar: General, Notebook, Editor, Notifications, Connections, Privacy and Help.</li>
  <li>The app icon choices show on the Mac.</li>
  <li>Getting Started no longer shows up under a person&#x27;s mentions because its examples use their name.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
