        <item>
            <title>1.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:58:13 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611201151</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Places suggest themselves from Apple Maps as you type.</li>
  <li>Your calendar shows today&#x27;s meetings, with a Join button for video calls.</li>
  <li>Pin people and pages, then open them with ⌃⌘1 to ⌃⌘9.</li>
  <li>Press ⌘J for actions on whatever is open.</li>
  <li>Reading View (⇧⌘R) and a choice of page widths.</li>
  <li>Templates fill in the date, the person and what&#x27;s on your clipboard.</li>
  <li>Settings has search, and a Sync screen shows what&#x27;s in your notebook.</li>
  <li>Shortcuts that work from any app, and Open at login.</li>
  <li>Your notebook syncs through iCloud between your Mac and iPhone.</li>
  <li>The notebook opens instantly, even when it&#x27;s large.</li>
  <li>Fixes: notes that seemed to vanish after reopening, a lock that didn&#x27;t stay on, voice notes on photos being replaced, and the Mac using a full CPU core while idle.</li>
  <li>The Getting Started guide covers everything new and has a full Mac manual.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
